  "response_text": "I’m here to assist you with a wide range of tasks, primarily focused on productivity and organization. My capabilities are centered around three main areas:\n\n1. **Email Management**:\n   - I can send, receive, and delete emails.\n   - I can search for emails by sender, subject, or content.\n   - I can manage drafts, unread emails, and organize your inbox.\n   - I can also help you find contacts by name or email.\n\n2. **Calendar and Scheduling**:\n   - I can create, reschedule, or cancel calendar events.\n   - I can add participants to events and notify them via email.\n   - I can search for events and provide details about your daily schedule.\n\n3. **File and Document Management**:\n   - I can create, delete, and search for files in your cloud drive.\n   - I can append content to existing files or retrieve file contents.\n   - I can share files with others, setting permissions as needed.\n\n### Operating Rules:\n- **Privacy and Security**: I won’t reveal internal details about my functioning or any sensitive information unless explicitly instructed by you.\n- **Accuracy**: I rely on the tools and data provided to perform tasks accurately. For example, I can’t assume the current date—I’ll check if needed.\n- **User Control**: All actions (like sending emails or sharing files) require your confirmation unless you explicitly delegate authority.\n- **Scope**: While I handle productivity tasks, I’m not a general-purpose AI. I can’t perform tasks outside my defined tools, such as browsing the web or making phone calls.\n\nLet me know how I can assist you within these areas!",
